{"id":248,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"The quakes caused when it walks make even great mountains crumble and change the surrounding terrain."},{"games":["Sword","HeartGold","LeafGreen","FireRed","Gold"],"text":"Its body can’t be harmed by any sort of attack, so it is very eager to make challenges against enemies."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon is a mobile disaster, leaving mountains crumbled and houses destroyed in its wake."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It wanders through the mountains seeking opponents to fight. If it finds an opponent that’s not worthy, Tyranitar ignores it and wanders on."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Tyranitar is so overwhelmingly powerful, it can bring down a whole mountain to make its nest. This Pokémon wanders about in mountains seeking new opponents to fight."},{"games":["Y","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"In just one of its mighty hands, it has the power to make the ground shake and mountains crumble."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Extremely strong, it can change the landscape. It has an insolent nature that makes it not care about others."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A TYRANITAR is so overwhelmingly powerful, it can bring down a whole mountain to make its nest. It roams in mountains seeking new opponents to fight."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sand Stream","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon summons a sandstorm when it enters a battle."},{"name":"Unnerve","hidden":true,"description":"Unnerves opposing Pokémon and makes them unable to eat Berries."}],"eggGroups":["Monster"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"mountain","color":"Green","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":246,"name":"Larvitar","condition":null,"children":[{"id":247,"name":"Pupitar",